## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| CLAUDE_MODEL env not set by all tools | Fallback chain: env → JSON → "unknown". Graceful degradation. |
| git diff unavailable (new repo, detached HEAD) | Fallback to 1..line_count with contributor_type=Unknown |
| Webhook endpoint unreachable | fire-and-forget with ureq timeout (2s). Never block hook pipeline. |
| Team ID resolution ambiguous | Use CODEFLOW_TEAM env var as primary source, config file as fallback |
